---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Garden Route Restaurants"
  description="About gardenroute-restaurants.co.za — the most complete hand-curated restaurant directory for the Garden Route, South Africa. Covering Knysna, Plettenberg Bay, George, Mossel Bay and more."
>
  <Nav />

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 list-none p-0 m-0">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-gray-600 no-underline">Home</a></li>
        <li>›</li>
        <li class="text-gray-600 font-medium">About</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About Garden Route Restaurants</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong>gardenroute-restaurants.co.za</strong> is the most complete restaurant directory for the Garden Route, South Africa — covering Knysna, Plettenberg Bay, Wilderness, George, Mossel Bay, Sedgefield, and Storms River.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">How it works</h2>
      <p>
        Every listing is personally researched and written to capture what makes each restaurant worth visiting — the atmosphere, standout dishes, and the kind of experience you can expect. Ratings, hours, and contact details are kept up to date so you always have accurate information before you head out.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">The Garden Route dining scene</h2>
      <p>
        The Garden Route is one of South Africa's premier travel destinations, stretching along the Western Cape coast between Mossel Bay and Storms River. Its restaurant scene reflects the region's diversity — you'll find everything from casual lagoon-side cafés to award-winning fine dining, farm-to-table bistros, and world-class seafood.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/browse?town=Knysna" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">Knysna</a> is the heart of the route, known for its oysters, waterfront restaurants, and buzzing café culture on Thesen Islands. <a href="/browse?town=Plettenberg+Bay" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">Plettenberg Bay</a> offers upmarket dining with ocean views. <a href="/browse?town=Wilderness" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">Wilderness</a> is beloved for its relaxed, nature-immersed restaurants. <a href="/browse?town=George" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">George</a> is the region's commercial hub with a wide variety of options, while <a href="/browse?town=Mossel+Bay" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">Mossel Bay</a> blends heritage charm with harbour-fresh seafood.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Contact & updates</h2>
      <p>
        Found an error, want to suggest a restaurant, or need to update your listing? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za" class="text-ocean-600 hover:underline">info@gardenroute-restaurants.co.za</a>
        and we'll get it sorted.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-100 py-8 px-6 mt-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center text-sm text-gray-400">
      © 2026 gardenroute-restaurants.co.za
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>
